# 基本文章編集をプロセスで (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py: a copy of 基本文章編集 with
# 30 paragraphs (mkbig doc 30) opened with the text editor running as a process (pdoc), the
# caret put in the second paragraph, abc typed and saved with Ctrl+S; closed with Ctrl+E
# and opened again, the record read back is the one saved, and the caret goes where it is
# put again. The wheel winds it.
# Keys: Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01, ↓ 51.
mkbig doc 30
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 30
wait 500
logmark
click 300 170
expectsince document: drew
logmark
text abc
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 300
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince document: saved (0)
sum
keep saved
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince document: window kept 100,100 600x400
expectsince document: closed
wait 500
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 30
wait 500
sum
same saved
logmark
move 400 300
wheel -3
expectsince document: drew
logmark
key 51
expectsince document: key to screen
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince document: closed
